      "name": "What's the fundamental difference between vanity metrics and predictive ABM KPIs?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "The core difference lies in their ability to signal intent and progression toward a sale. Vanity metrics show general activity, while predictive KPIs reveal specific behaviors indicating a buyer is actively moving through their journey. Predictive KPIs inform next-best actions and provide a clearer path to pipeline attribution."
      }
    },
