      "name": "What role does Sales Accepted Lead (SAL) velocity play in ABM pipeline prediction?",
      "acceptedAnswer": {
        "@type": "Answer",
        "text": "SAL velocity within target accounts measures how quickly an engaged account transitions from marketing-qualified to sales-accepted and then to a qualified opportunity. A high velocity indicates effective marketing-sales alignment and strong buyer intent, directly predicting faster pipeline movement. This metric helps prioritize accounts most likely to close and accelerates the entire sales cycle."
